senses.gloss:
कनीन + .{@-नी@}
—1 The little finger.
—2 The pupil of the eye.

कनीनकः + .{@-का@}
—1 maiden, girl; कनीनकेन विद्रधे Rv. 4. 32. 23.
—2 The pupil of the eye; या कनीनका तयादित्यो Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 2.

कनीनकः + .{@-निका@}
—1 The little finger.
—2 The pupil of the eye.

कांस्य + .{@-स्यम्@}
—1 Bell-metal or white copper; Ms. 5. 114; Y. 1. 190.
—2 A gong of bell-metal; Mb. 4. 3 A kind of measure.
